3chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/FEh9R8dacAIYEH2.jpg\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"yutkat","author_subname":"@yutkat","author_link":"https://twitter.com/yutkat/status/1461556106501582854","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1249871687006339074/Zw6P3xoh_normal.png","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/voluntas/status/1461489255839002624\u003e \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/FEh9R8dacAIYEH2.jpg\u003e","image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FEh9R8dacAIYEH2.jpg","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1637297104,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/yutkat/status/1461556106501582854","original_url":"https://twitter.com/yutkat/status/1461556106501582854"},{"color":"32BBF3","fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/voluntas|@voluntas\u003e: 人を騙して何が嬉しいのか。 \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/FEhAspEaUAAXzw1.jpg\u003e","id":2,"author_name":"V","author_subname":"@voluntas","author_link":"https://twitter.com/voluntas/status/1461489255839002624","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/858198338444836864/OFlImt8f_normal.jpg","text":"人を騙して何が嬉しいのか。 \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/FEhAspEaUAAXzw1.jpg\u003e","image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FEhAspEaUAAXzw1.jpg","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1637281166,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/voluntas/status/1461489255839002624"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"94ZT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9acb42a6-ab63-4a6f-899d-f51f6e1f115c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"我々の体の中にはVimがある…つまり我々はVimである(いいえ)","ts":"1637293380.387400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"vimvim","count":4,"users":["U81LLJ340","U7JL1UKKL","U02G79NJMLY","UA1GWETAA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aK7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fdaddf04-7c54-49f1-a6a4-e6ddd341f38c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"\u0026gt; 超音波発生装置から出る千本近い超音波を、視床Vim核という場所に集中的に当てて温度を上げ、熱で固めます。視床Vim核はふるえの増強に関わっていることがわかっており、このはたらきを抑えることでふるえを止めるのです。","ts":"1637293357.386600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"23p"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d1ee5f87-0a16-4ebc-937f-380453f1b88a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"本日のVim情報 \u003chttps://www.nhk.jp/p/kenko-choice/ts/7JKJ2P6JVQ/episode/te/JRQVKQ849G/|https://www.nhk.jp/p/kenko-choice/ts/7JKJ2P6JVQ/episode/te/JRQVKQ849G/\u003e","ts":"1637293279.386300","attachments":[{"fallback":"チョイス@病気になったとき - NHK: 「なんとかしたい 手のふるえ」 - チョイス@病気になったとき","id":1,"title":"「なんとかしたい 手のふるえ」 - チョイス@病気になったとき","title_link":"https://www.nhk.jp/p/kenko-choice/ts/7JKJ2P6JVQ/episode/te/JRQVKQ849G/","text":"手がふるえる症状に悩んでいる人は、全国に約３００万人いると推定され、そのほとんどを占めるのが「本態性振戦」。手を動かそうとした時にふるえが起きる。主な治療は、高血圧の治療にも使われる「β遮断薬」。２０１９年には、脳の原因部位を超音波で固めて破壊する最新治療「ＦＵＳ（集束超音波治療）」も登場した。「パーキンソン病」や「バセドウ病」などの意外な原因の見分け方、原因別の治療のチョイスを詳しく伝える。","image_url":"https://www.nhk.or.jp/pr-image/e39f863f0acaea9c2bb0ca30fd5551ba_ll.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"チョイス@病気になったとき - NHK","service_icon":"https://www.nhk.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://www.nhk.jp/p/kenko-choice/ts/7JKJ2P6JVQ/episode/te/JRQVKQ849G/","original_url":"https://www.nhk.jp/p/kenko-choice/ts/7JKJ2P6JVQ/episode/te/JRQVKQ849G/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"INeot"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6289abbd-840d-4a29-87fb-077e2f7b1559","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"まぁこれだけは言える。FX はヤバいので気軽に手を出してはならない。(FX違い)","ts":"1637292470.385900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"vim-is-my-life","count":2,"users":["U028A974153","UDPT2BZ6E"]},{"name":"fx","count":3,"users":["U0238G3KV8D","U81LLJ340","U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tYK/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1d53c9b9-f664-4790-be3c-88857ea0038c","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"読んでなくてタイトルだけから推測すると Power Query の凄い版なのでは。","ts":"1637292397.384700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"vim-is-my-life","count":1,"users":["U028A974153"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gi3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"93a74b31-d337-4302-b492-39ce5d13c935","type":"message","user":"U02BDFBM620","text":"ある意味ではAWKやCOBOLみたいにデータを処理してレポートを出力するのが目的のDSLなのかな","ts":"1637291945.383200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qq0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"020ed957-f127-4a18-887a-44d71579edc7","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"老巧度","ts":"1637291823.381600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nIz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f534c0a9-cac8-4346-b07c-b6abb388a587","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://www.publickey1.jp/blog/21/excelpower_fx.html\u003e\n\u003chttps://github.com/microsoft/power-fx\u003e\nなにか出てきましたね。（どう使うんだろう？）","ts":"1637290139.381000","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"microsoft/Power-Fx","id":1,"title":"microsoft/Power-Fx","text":"Power Fx low-code programming language","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"2449","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"C#","short":true}],"blocks":null},{"fallback":"マイクロソフト、Excel関数ベースのローコード言語「Power Fx」をオープンソースで公開。さまざまなソフトウェアでの採用が可能に","id":2,"title":"マイクロソフト、Excel関数ベースのローコード言語「Power Fx」をオープンソースで公開。さまざまなソフトウェアでの採用が可能に","title_link":"https://www.publickey1.jp/blog/21/excelpower_fx.html","text":"マイクロソフトは、Excel関数をベースにしたローコード開発向けのプログラミング言語「Power Fx」の実装をオープンソースで公開しました。 Power Fxはマイクロソフトにとって初めてのローコード開発向けのプログラミング言語です。...","image_url":"https://www.publickey1.jp/2021/powerfxoss.gif","blocks":null,"service_name":"publickey1.jp","service_icon":"https://www.publickey1.jp/favicon.ico","from_ur